    bottomLine: "For a ground-floor home gym or small studio that wants a commercial-style converging decline press it can order on Amazon. Confirm the footprint in writing.",
    description: "French Fitness sells its Tahoe line of plate-loaded machines through fitness dealers and on Amazon. The decline chest press’s Amazon listing describes iso-lateral, independent arms that converge, an 11-gauge steel frame, spring-assisted seat height adjustment, molded foam pads and urethane grips. Fitness Superstore, a dealer, lists the same 11-gauge frame and says its silver Diablo decline press is the same machine, with handles that start wide and move toward the middle as you press. The Amazon listing also gives a machine weight and dimensions that we found nowhere else, so they are not on the card; ask for the spec sheet for your unit. We saw it at $2,619 on Amazon on 9 November 2026, against a $2,899 retail price at the dealer. It takes the slot the Hammer Strength Iso-Lateral Wide Chest held on this page: Hammer Strength is sold through Life Fitness and commercial dealers, not on Amazon, and this is the closest converging decline press we found there.",
  },
  {
    id: "body-solid-lvbp",
    name: "Body-Solid Pro ClubLine Leverage Bench Press (LVBP)",
