      "Gas-assisted start positions make seat and arm changes quick between users",
      "Sealed-bearing pivots and built-in plate storage",
      "At 30 in high, per Body-Solid, it suits low basement ceilings",
    ],
    cons: [
      "Body-Solid gives the weight as 154 lb on its product page and 169 lb in its listing copy, so we left it out",
      "A lying bench press rather than a seated press",
      "Shown out of stock on Body-Solid’s own store when we checked, though Amazon listed it",
    ],
    bottomLine: "For a home gym that wants a commercial-grade converging bench press with quick adjustments and a published price.",
    description: "Body-Solid’s Pro ClubLine LVBP is a plate-loaded leverage bench: you lie on the bench and press two independent arms that, in Body-Solid’s words, give converging unilateral movement and mimic the natural arc of a barbell bench press. Gas-assisted start positions set the seat and arms for different users, the pivots run on sealed bearings, and the 2 x 3 in, 11-gauge steel mainframe carries storage horns for Olympic plates, which are sold separately. Body-Solid gives the footprint as 69 x 53 x 30 in (L x W x H) on its product page and in its Amazon copy; we found no independent source for it, so it is not in the specification line. Body-Solid’s product page gives the weight as 154 lb and its listing copy as 169 lb, so we have left weight out too. We saw it at $1,095 on Amazon and as a $1,095 sale price against a $1,385 list price on Body-Solid’s store, where it showed as temporarily out of stock, on 9 November 2026. It replaces the Hoist ROC-IT Chest Press here: Hoist sells direct and through dealers, not on Amazon, and no moving-seat press is listed there.",
  },
  {
    id: "gmwd-folding-chest-press",
    name: "GMWD Chest Press Machine with Independent Converging Arms",
    brand: "GMWD",
    category: "Folding budget converging press",
    badge: "Cheapest Converging Press",
    amazonUrl: "https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C4L4CN2Y?tag=sktiger-20&linkCode=ll1",
    amazonLabel: "Check Price on Amazon",
    image: {"url":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/419HnlLvpEL._SL500_.jpg","width":500,"height":382},
    reviewUrl: null,
    priceRange: "$189.99",
    priceBounds: {"low":189.99,"high":189.99},
    specs: "Independent converging arms · 11 arm positions · upright, incline and flat bench · folds with a locking pin · detachable sleeves for 1 in and 2 in plates",
